config PCI
    bool "PCI"
    default y
    help
      PCI and PCI Express devices below the host bridges the
      firmware describes, with the bridges between them

config ISA
    bool "ISA"
    depends on PCI
    default y
    help
      Devices behind a PCI-ISA bridge as the firmware describes
      them, such as the PS/2 controller and COM ports of the
      chipset
